NOTE ON COURSEWORK

Some projects in this archive were completed as university coursework
(Johns Hopkins University, Rutgers University) or their group projects.
The task descriptions, starter code, and assignment framing in those
projects may originate from the respective courses and instructors, and
their rights are reserved by those parties.

If you are a current student in any of these courses, please do not
submit this code as your own work. This archive exists so you can read
and understand the approach — not to supply answers.
